## 3. @ Modifier (Volatile Symbols)

Allows symbols to act as mutable variables that update across passes.

### Syntax
```
counter@ = counter + 1
```

### Behavior
- Symbol is marked "volatile"
- Value updates during every pass
- Does NOT cause stabilization failure (ignored in stability check)

### Example
```
    org &1000
count = 0
    lda #count
count@ = count+1
    lda #count
count@ = count+1
    lda #count
```

### Output
```
     1000   A9 00      LDA #&00
     1002   A9 01      LDA #&01
     1004   A9 02      LDA #&02
```

