## 6. LOCKFILE Command

Locks a file on a disc image to prevent modification.
Directory is optional and defaults to $. if omitted.

### Syntax
```
LOCKFILE "Filename"
```

### Example
```
.start
    EQUS "Data"
.end

SAVE "Locked", start, end
LOCKFILE "Locked"
```

