## 7. FUNCTION Feature

User-defined functions with parameters and return values.

### Syntax
```
FUNCTION name param1, param2, ...
    ; code
    RETURN value
ENDFUNCTION
```

### Features
- Parameters passed by value
- Local variables (scoped to function)
- IF/ELIF/ELSE/ENDIF support
- Nested function calls
- **Parse-time RETURN detection**: Error if function has no RETURN statement

### Example
```
FUNCTION sum a, b, c
    result = a + b + c
    RETURN result
ENDFUNCTION

total = sum(1, 2, 3)    ; total = 6

FUNCTION max a, b
    IF a > b
        RETURN a
    ELSE
        RETURN b
    ENDIF
ENDFUNCTION
```

### Implementation
- Independent function scope (not tied to FOR stack)
- Automatic cleanup of local variables on return
- Symbols use function scope IDs

